  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are capable of mitigating the negative effects of fate upon yourself.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Fatespinning class feature, Cha 15, Wis 15</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Penalties imposed upon you by rolls on Table: Tell Fortune Outcomes that were triggered by spending fate points last for 1 round per class level.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Penalties imposed upon you by rolls on Table: Tell Fortune Outcomes that were triggered by spending fate points last for 1 minute per class level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
